---
import LegalLayout from '../components/ui/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site.ts';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  path="/privacy/"
  description="How ErrorsFree collects, uses and protects the information you share with us."
  updated="August 2026"
>
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    {site.legalName} is a software development and consultancy business based in {site.contact.address}.
    In this policy, "we" and "us" mean {site.legalName}, and "you" means anyone who visits this
    website or contacts us through it.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>We collect only what we need to answer you and to run this website:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information you give us.</strong> Your name, email address, company, budget range and the message you send through our contact or newsletter forms.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical information.</strong> Standard server logs recorded by our hosting provider, including IP address, browser type and the pages requested.</li>
    <li><strong>Preferences stored on your device.</strong> Your chosen colour palette and light or dark mode are saved in your browser's local storage. This never leaves your device and we cannot read it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
  <p>
    We do not use advertising trackers, cross-site profiling, or third-party analytics that
    identify you personally. We do not sell, rent or trade your information to anyone.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to your enquiry and, if it goes further, to prepare a proposal.</li>
    <li>To send you our newsletter, if you asked for it. Every issue carries an unsubscribe link.</li>
    <li>To keep this website secure and working.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>
    We share your information only with service providers that make this website and our
    correspondence work — our hosting provider and our email provider — and only to the extent
    they need it. We may disclose information where we are legally required to do so.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    Enquiries are retained for as long as there is an active or prospective working relationship,
    and for a reasonable period afterwards for our records. Newsletter subscriptions are kept until
    you unsubscribe. Server logs are retained on our host's standard cycle.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us for a copy of the information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us
    to delete it. Email <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a> and we will
    respond within a reasonable period.
  </p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>
    This site is served over HTTPS. We apply reasonable technical and organisational measures to
    protect the information you send us. No transmission over the internet is completely secure, and
    we cannot guarantee absolute security.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy. The date at the top of this page shows when it last changed.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>
    or {site.contact.phone}.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
